OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTonight, it
OL,6,Fwill feel much chillier under clear
OL,7,Fskies with a touch of frost in rural,
OL,8,Fsheltered areas. The odd patch of mist
OL,9,Fand fog may develop. Remaining dry
OL,10,Fwith light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA bright start on Monday,
OL,13,Fremaining dry throughout for many with
OL,14,Fjust the odd light shower further
OL,15,Feast. Feeling fresher in a northerly
OL,16,Fbreeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
