OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FRemaining largely dry through the
OL,7,Fperiod with high pressure dominating.
OL,8,FPlenty of sunny spells on offer, yet
OL,9,Fbreezy, with the risk of the odd light
OL,10,Fshower where cloud thickens.
